  "title": "Rare Penthouse with Private Rooftop patio - 2Bed, 2Bath and Den - apartments / housing for rent - craigslist",
  "bodyText": "CL\n\nvancouver, BC >\n\nvancouver >\n\nhousing >\n\napartments / housing for rent\n\npost\naccount\nreply \nfavorite\n \nhide\n \n⚐\nflag\n \n\nshare\n\nPosted 5 days ago\n\nprint\n$4,800 / 2br - 1053ft2 - Rare Penthouse with Private Rooftop patio - 2Bed, 2Bath and Den (Kitsilano)\n2565 Maple Street, Vancouver, BC V6J0C8\n© craigslist - Map data © OpenStreetMap\n2565 Maple Street\n2BR / 2Ba 1053ft2 available now\nrent period: monthly\napartment\nw/d in unit\nattached garage\nno smoking\nair conditioning\nSTUNNING PENTHOUSE LIVING IN THE HEART OF KITSILANO!\n\nExperience the best of indoor-outdoor living in this exceptional A/C penthouse, featuring an impressive 843 SF private rooftop patio — the perfect setting for summer BBQs, entertaining guests, gardening, or simply soaking up the sun. A second balcony overlooking a quiet, tree-lined street offers an additional outdoor retreat.\n\nInside, enjoy a bright and spacious open-concept layout with 9' ceilings, complemented by a chef-inspired kitchen featuring granite countertops, elegant Scavolini cabinetry, stainless steel appliances, an integrated refrigerator, and a gas cooktop. Generously sized bedrooms, a spa-inspired bathroom, and a thoughtfully designed floor plan complete this inviting home.\n\nResidents enjoy access to excellent building amenities, including a fitness centre, landscaped courtyard, and playground.\n\nIdeally situated just steps from Kitsilano Beach, beautiful parks, trendy cafés, popular restaurants, boutique shopping, and convenient transit.\n\nA rare opportunity to enjoy penthouse living with exceptional outdoor space in one of Vancouver's most sought-after neighbourhoods!\n\nPROPERTY FEATURES:\n– 2 Bedroom\n– 2 Bathroom\n– Den\n– In-suite laundry\n– 1 Parking Spot\n– Storage locker and Bike locker\n-Balcony and Roof Top\n-Air conditioning\n\nAMENITIES:\n– Elevators\n– Secured underground parking\n– Equipped exercise centre\n– Game rooms\n\nPETS NEGOTIABLE / NO SMOKING\n\nTERMS:\nMinimum 12-month lease\n1/2 months rent deposit\nTenant’s insurance is a must\nCredit check required\nMove in/out fee as per Strata\n\n\npost id: 7993260063\n\n \n\nposted: 5 days ago\n\n \n\nupdated: 4 days ago\n\n \n\n♥ best of [?]\n\nhelp\nsafety\nprivacy\nterms\nabout\napp\n© 2026 craigslist",
